## [P1] Browser Testing - Gallery Functionality

**Status**: Not Started
**Complexity**: LOW (manual testing, no code changes unless issues found)
**Effort**: Small (30 minutes testing + variable fix time)
**Dependencies**: P0-3 must be complete (procedural animations must work)
**Spec Reference**: Gallery functional requirements • **Status Reference**: STATUS-2025-12-09-035528.md § "Runtime Assessment - React Gallery"

### Description

Gallery builds successfully but has NEVER been tested in an actual browser. Need to verify that all UI interactions work and animation previews load correctly in iframes.

**Critical Unknown**: Iframe path resolution may be incorrect, causing animation previews to fail loading.

### Acceptance Criteria

- [ ] Dev server starts successfully (`cd gallery && pnpm run dev`)
- [ ] Gallery renders in browser at http://localhost:5173
- [ ] All 10 technique sections are visible in accordion UI
- [ ] Clicking section headers toggles expand/collapse state
- [ ] Expanded sections show 6 animation cards each (original/varied/procedural for logo/text)
- [ ] Animation preview iframes load and display animations
- [ ] Animations auto-play on iframe load (entrance → hold → exit → waiting)
- [ ] "Restart" buttons are visible on animation cards
- [ ] Clicking "Restart" triggers animation to restart from beginning
- [ ] All 60 animations are accessible and functional
- [ ] No console errors in browser DevTools
- [ ] Dynamic text animations work (if implemented)

### Technical Notes

**Test Procedure**:

1. Start dev server:
```bash
cd /Users/bmf/code/loom99-animations/gallery
pnpm run dev
```

2. Open browser to http://localhost:5173

3. Systematically test each section:
   - Click to expand
   - Verify 6 cards appear
   - Check that previews load
   - Test restart buttons
   - Verify animations behave correctly

4. Check browser console for errors

**Common Issues to Watch For**:
- **Iframe paths incorrect**: Animation files return 404
  - Check `PreviewFrame.tsx` iframe src construction
  - Verify `vite.config.ts` copies animation files to dist/
  - Confirm `animations.ts` filePath values are correct
- **postMessage not working**: Restart buttons don't trigger animations
  - Check message listener setup in animation HTML files
  - Verify message passing in PreviewFrame component
- **CORS issues**: Browser blocks iframe content
  - Should not happen with relative paths, but check console
- **State machine bug still present**: Animations loop infinitely
  - Means P0-3 fix didn't work or wasn't applied

**If Issues Found**:
- Document each issue with screenshots and console logs
- Create new work items for fixes
- Prioritize based on severity (blockers vs polish)

